# trd unit cube centered at the origin (side 1, spanning ±0.5), white.
# 8 vertices, 6 quad faces; each `f a b c d` fan-triangulates to two triangles.
# Used by examples/frames.multimesh.jsonl as mesh 1 alongside the bunny (mesh 0)
# to demo the protocol 0.0.3 multi-mesh draw list.
v -0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5 -0.5 -0.5
v  0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5  0.5 -0.5
v -0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5 -0.5  0.5
v  0.5  0.5  0.5
v -0.5  0.5  0.5
f 1 2 3 4
f 5 6 7 8
f 1 5 8 4
f 2 6 7 3
f 4 8 7 3
f 1 5 6 2
